# Deny by default: only the application source closure enters this build context.
**
!backend/
!backend/**
!dist/
!dist/**
!infra/
!infra/nginx/
!infra/nginx/default.conf
!infra/selfhost/
!infra/selfhost/Dockerfile.*

# These exclusions must follow the allowlist, including for nested backend/dist files.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.git
**/.git/**
**/.agent
**/.agent/**
**/.agents
**/.agents/**
**/.codex
**/.codex/**
**/.claude
**/.claude/**
**/.Codex
**/.Codex/**
**/local-secrets
**/local-secrets/**
**/secrets
**/secrets/**
**/.netrc
**/auth.json
**/*credentials*.json
**/*cookies*.json
**/*cookies*.txt
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*

# Runtime, private content, databases, evidence and exports are not application code.
**/runtime
**/runtime/**
**/data
**/data/**
**/private
**/private/**
**/exports
**/exports/**
**/artifacts
**/artifacts/**
**/tmp
**/tmp/**
**/temp
**/temp/**
**/pg_data
**/pg_data/**
**/redis_data
**/redis_data/**
**/qdrant_data
**/qdrant_data/**
**/neo4j_data
**/neo4j_data/**
**/minio_data
**/minio_data/**
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.dump
**/*.sql
**/*.backup
**/*.jsonl
**/*.parquet
**/*.log
**/celerybeat-schedule*
**/celerybeat.pid

# Installed dependency trees and test/build caches are kept in the runtime image.
**/node_modules
**/node_modules/**
**/.venv
**/.venv/**
**/.venv-cli
**/.venv-cli/**
**/venv
**/venv/**
**/__pycache__
**/__pycache__/**
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.pytest_cache/**
**/.ruff_cache
**/.ruff_cache/**
**/.mypy_cache
**/.mypy_cache/**
**/.next
**/.next/**
**/.turbo
**/.turbo/**
**/coverage
**/coverage/**
**/playwright-report
**/playwright-report/**
**/test-results
**/test-results/**
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
